      "content": "i know people say they want to help, but it doesn't change the reality. he's working extra hours just to cover the costs and then he comes home and has to do all my physical care too. he looks so tired all the time. it feels less like he's \"helping\" and more like he's just trapped in this life because he feels like he has to take care of me. i hate that i'm the reason he can't just be free.",
